body:
Good to know that I'm not the only one :+1:

We upgraded our app to 4.1.0.beta1 and we hit the same issue. However, I tried doing this on a freshly generated app and cannot reproduce the issue. So, I'm still not 100% sure what's the root cause.

I tried this in the Rails console:

``` irb
Loading staging environment (Rails 4.1.0.beta1)
irb(main):001:0> Rails.application.config.action_mailer.default_url_options
=> {:host=>"s.caliper.io"}
irb(main):002:0> ActionMailer::Base.default_url_options
=> {}
irb(main):003:0> Rails.application.config.action_mailer.default_url_options = {host: 'example.com'}
=> {:host=>"example.com"}
irb(main):004:0> Rails.application.config.action_mailer.default_url_options
=> {:host=>"example.com"}
irb(main):005:0> ActionMailer::Base.default_url_options
=> {}
irb(main):006:0> ActionMailer::Base.default_url_options = {host: 'example.net'}
=> {:host=>"example.net"}
irb(main):007:0> ActionMailer::Base.default_url_options
=> {:host=>"example.net"}
irb(main):008:0> Rails.application.config.action_mailer.default_url_options
=> {:host=>"example.com"}
```

Bam! I think I figured out a way to reproduce this with a fresh app:

